@startuml
!include _style.iuml

hide footbox

actor "You" as U
participant "Host app" as H
participant "KDE Purpose" as P
participant "Plugin" as M
participant "uguu.se" as S $EXTERNAL
participant "Plasma\n(D-Bus)" as D

== 1. Start ==
U -> H : Share › Upload to Uguu
H -> P : mimeType + file URLs
P -> P : listen on /tmp/randomname-N
P -> M : start main.py --server /tmp/randomname-N

== 2. Purpose protocol ==
M -> P : connect to the socket
P -> M : request: length line + CBOR map
M -> M : decode, check dependencies,\nvalidate the file
M -> P : {"percent": 10}

== 3. Upload (the only network traffic) ==
M -> S : POST /upload (multipart, field files[])
S --> M : 200 {"files": [{"url": "https://h.uguu.se/..."}]}

== 4. Result ==
M -> P : {"percent": 100, "output": {"url": "..."}}
M -> P : close the socket
P -> H : job finished: output.url
note over H
  **Dolphin / Krusader:** opens link in browser
  **Spectacle:** waits for plugin notification
end note

== 5. After the socket is closed ==
M -> D : Klipper: setClipboardContents(link)
M -> D : Notify: "Uploaded to Uguu"
M -> M : exit 0
note over H, P : The host app does **not** wait\nfor the clipboard or the notification.
@enduml
